# swift asynchronous file metadata. Forwards to the linked `stat` runtime shim (POSIX `stat`, handed back), which
# builds the record in one call rather than one call per field. Internal: reached only through the public file/metadata API.
#
# `aio` is docked for its `handBack`, the swift runtime's one pool, which the `stat` shim calls (decision 001).

dock load
  load <global:stat>, name stat
  load <global:aio>, name aio
  load <global:loop>, name term-loop

load @term/base/file/metadata
  find file-metadata

task meta-read
  mark async
  take path, like text
  take
    follow
    like boolean
    fall true
  like file-metadata
  send back
    call stat/meta-read
      read path
      read follow
      wait true
